<title>NORWAY: Aker Martime Q1 pre-tax rises 13 pct.</title>
<headline>Aker Martime Q1 pre-tax rises 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31.</p>
<p>				   (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Operating income		 2,986     vs	 2,331</p>
<p>  Operating result		    72     vs	    65</p>
<p>  Pre-tax result			76     vs	    67   Net</p>
<p>result			    50     vs	    44</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian offshore services company is Aker Maritime ASA. The company was formed in November, 1996, after Aker ASA spun off its Oil and Gas Technology division and merged it with offshore supplier Maritime Group. A Reuter poll of ten analysts forecast an operating result of 71 million crowns and pre-tax profits of 73 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
